WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
We do not all flower at once.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.918
In Rose Park, colours change with the seasons and the garden’s care.

00:00:07.218 --> 00:00:11.258
Notice our shapes, leaves and the space between bushes.

00:00:11.558 --> 00:00:17.200
The city of gardens also reveals itself through small things on an unhurried walk.
